+7. Build camera intrinsics. Prefer explicit $f_x, f_y, c_x, c_y$. Fallback to computing from FoV: $f_x = w / (2.0 \tan(\text{FoV}_x / 2.0))$. Last resort fallback sets $f_x = f_y = 0.5(w + h)$ [S1, unofficial].
